<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 11:00:03 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>南非 IDC 正在洽谈收购糖业公司 2.57 亿美元的股份</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/south-africa-s-idc-in-talks-for-257-million-stake-in-sugar-firm</link><description>南非最大的发展金融机构计划以 45 亿兰特（2.57 亿美元）的价格收购一家投资公司的股份，该公司正在寻求收购南非最大的甜味剂精炼商 Tongaat Hulett Sugar SA Ltd. 的股份。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/south-africa-s-idc-in-talks-for-257-million-stake-in-sugar-firm'&gt;南非 IDC 正在洽谈收购糖业公司 2.57 亿美元的股份&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：South Africa’s IDC in Talks for $257 Million Stake in Sugar Firm&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/south-africa-s-idc-in-talks-for-257-million-stake-in-sugar-firm</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 09:55:38 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</link><description>在华尔街后期复苏将纳斯达克100指数从熊市边缘拉出来之后，亚洲股市似乎有望小幅上涨，同时对人工智能交易可持续性的持续担忧提振了美国国债。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates'&gt;亚洲股市在美国尾盘反弹后有望上涨：市场结束&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Global Stocks Climb as AI Trade Mounts a Comeback: Markets Wrap&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-25/stock-market-today-dow-s-p-live-updates</guid><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:10:42 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>越南考虑将核电站推迟到 2035 年之后</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/vietnam-weighs-delaying-nuclear-power-plants-beyond-2035-target</link><description>越南可能被迫将其第一座核电站推迟到 2035 年之后，从而使促进能源安全和经济增长的努力变得更加复杂。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/vietnam-weighs-delaying-nuclear-power-plants-beyond-2035-target'&gt;越南考虑将核电站推迟到 2035 年之后&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Vietnam Weighs Delaying Nuclear Power Plants Beyond 2035&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/vietnam-weighs-delaying-nuclear-power-plants-beyond-2035-target</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 06:32:14 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>罗马尼亚极右翼领导人西蒙被控煽动暴力</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/romanian-far-right-leader-simion-charged-with-inciting-violence</link><description>罗马尼亚极右翼领导人乔治·西蒙 (George Simion) 因涉嫌在去年竞争激烈的 2024 年总统选举后敦促对选举局法官使用暴力而被检察官指控公开煽动。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/romanian-far-right-leader-simion-charged-with-inciting-violence'&gt;罗马尼亚极右翼领导人西蒙被控煽动暴力&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Romanian Far-Right Leader Simion Charged With Inciting Violence&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-26/romanian-far-right-leader-simion-charged-with-inciting-violence</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:49:18 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>华尔街从人工智能的狂热转向悲观</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/wall-street-flips-from-ai-euphoria-to-gloom</link><description>美国股市多年来从未如此波动过。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/wall-street-flips-from-ai-euphoria-to-gloom'&gt;华尔街从人工智能的狂热转向悲观&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Wall Street Flips From AI Euphoria to Gloom&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/newsletters/2026-11-26/wall-street-flips-from-ai-euphoria-to-gloom</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:56:52 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>